<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Armato agrees sweet firm buys.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Armato agrees sweet firm buys.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Armato Corp Ltd said on Monday it had agreed to buy Page Confectioners Ltd, including its subsidiary National Candy Industries, and Alpine Importers Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The firm also said shareholders should exercise caution in their dealings in its shares until further details of the acquisitions are announced.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
